          {
            "title": "Question: What is a Port?",
            "id": 119524,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono le porte in un web server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Consenti a più applicazioni di condividere una singola connessione a un server</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Approva e rifiuta le richieste in arrivo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Analizza le richieste in arrivo e ordinalle in base all'ordine di arrivo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Consenti a più applicazioni di condividere una singola connessione a un server.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'app del menu ascolta sulla porta <code>3000</code> e quella delle prenotazioni sulla <code>8080</code> dello stesso server.</p><p>Invii una richiesta alla porta <code>8080</code>. Quale app la riceve?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'app delle prenotazioni, perché la sua porta corrisponde alla richiesta.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'app del menu, perché il numero della sua porta è inferiore.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le app, perché vengono eseguite sullo stesso server.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">L’app avviata per prima, indipendentemente dalla sua porta.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'app delle prenotazioni, perché la sua porta corrisponde alla richiesta.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: res.status()",
            "id": 132458,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale codice di stato riceverà il client quando chiamerà l'endpoint <code>/about</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;p&gt;Successful Request&lt;/p&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">200</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">400</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">201</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 200.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale codice di stato riceverà il client quando chiamerà l'endpoint <code>/about</code>?</p><p>Leggi l'handler di <code>/about</code> e individua il codice di stato restituito al client.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" express = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;express&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" app = express();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port = \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/about&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`New request made: \" /><text value=\"${req.method}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;&lt;p&gt;Successful Request&lt;/p&gt;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.listen(port, () =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Server is running on port \" /><text value=\"${port}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Server is running on port 3000\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"New request made: GET\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">200</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">400</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">201</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">404</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 200.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Express Server",
